        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Valuair, Jetstar Asia Airways\n- Places: Singapore, Indonesia\n- Topics: low-cost airlines, airline acquisition, airline branding\n\nFacts:\n- Valuair was a Singapore-based low-cost carrier.\n- In 2005, Jetstar Asia Airways acquired Valuair.\n- After the 2005 acquisition, Jetstar Asia Airways retained the Valuair brand for scheduled services to major cities in Indonesia until October 2014.\n- Jetstar Asia Airways Pte Ltd, operating as Jetstar Asia, is a low-cost airline based in Singapore.",
